    <item>
      <title>Call for Papers</title>
      <link>http://10.226.35.14:8080/cfp/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>http://10.226.35.14:8080/cfp/</guid>
      <description>&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;We invite security professionals, researchers, and practitioners to submit presentations on threat hunting topics.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Presentations in English are strongly recommended&lt;/strong&gt;, as we welcome attendees from across Europe. However, French submissions will also be accepted, since the majority of attendees will still be French-speaking.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Each talk is allocated a &lt;strong&gt;1-hour slot&lt;/strong&gt;, including 10 minutes for questions.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Only PDF format is accepted for the presentation upload.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Please wait until the confirmation message appears before leaving the page to ensure your submission is processed correctly.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;All submissions will be reviewed by the conference board. You will be notified of the outcome once the review process is complete.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;form id=&#34;cfp-form&#34; class=&#34;mt-8 space-y-6 max-w-2xl&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;label for=&#34;company&#34; class=&#34;block text-sm font-medium mb-1&#34;&gt;Company &lt;span class=&#34;text-red-400&#34;&gt;*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/label&gt;&#xA;    &lt;input type=&#34;text&#34; id=&#34;company&#34; name=&#34;company&#34; required&#xA;      class=&#34;w-full px-4 py-2 rounded-lg bg-neutral-800 border border-neutral-700 text-neutral-100 focus:border-cyan-500 focus:ring-1 focus:ring-cyan-500 outline-none&#34; /&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;fieldset class=&#34;border border-neutral-700 rounded-lg p-4&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;legend class=&#34;text-sm font-semibold px-2&#34;&gt;Primary Speaker &lt;span class=&#34;text-red-400&#34;&gt;*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/legend&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mt-2&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div&gt;&#xA;        &lt;label for=&#34;primary-first&#34; class=&#34;block text-sm font-medium mb-1&#34;&gt;First Name &lt;span class=&#34;text-red-400&#34;&gt;*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/label&gt;&#xA;        &lt;input type=&#34;text&#34; id=&#34;primary-first&#34; name=&#34;primary_first_name&#34; required&#xA;          class=&#34;w-full px-4 py-2 rounded-lg bg-neutral-800 border border-neutral-700 text-neutral-100 focus:border-cyan-500 focus:ring-1 focus:ring-cyan-500 outline-none&#34; /&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div&gt;&#xA;        &lt;label for=&#34;primary-last&#34; class=&#34;block text-sm font-medium mb-1&#34;&gt;Last Name &lt;span class=&#34;text-red-400&#34;&gt;*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/label&gt;&#xA;        &lt;input type=&#34;text&#34; id=&#34;primary-last&#34; name=&#34;primary_last_name&#34; required&#xA;          class=&#34;w-full px-4 py-2 rounded-lg bg-neutral-800 border border-neutral-700 text-neutral-100 focus:border-cyan-500 focus:ring-1 focus:ring-cyan-500 outline-none&#34; /&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;mt-4&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;label for=&#34;primary-email&#34; class=&#34;block text-sm font-medium mb-1&#34;&gt;Email &lt;span class=&#34;text-red-400&#34;&gt;*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/label&gt;&#xA;      &lt;input type=&#34;email&#34; id=&#34;primary-email&#34; name=&#34;primary_email&#34; required&#xA;        class=&#34;w-full px-4 py-2 rounded-lg bg-neutral-800 border border-neutral-700 text-neutral-100 focus:border-cyan-500 focus:ring-1 focus:ring-cyan-500 outline-none&#34; /&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/fieldset&gt;&#xA;  &lt;fieldset class=&#34;border border-neutral-700 rounded-lg p-4&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;legend class=&#34;text-sm font-semibold px-2&#34;&gt;Secondary Speaker (Optional)&lt;/legend&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mt-2&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div&gt;&#xA;        &lt;label for=&#34;secondary-first&#34; class=&#34;block text-sm font-medium mb-1&#34;&gt;First Name&lt;/label&gt;&#xA;        &lt;input type=&#34;text&#34; id=&#34;secondary-first&#34; name=&#34;secondary_first_name&#34;&#xA;          class=&#34;w-full px-4 py-2 rounded-lg bg-neutral-800 border border-neutral-700 text-neutral-100 focus:border-cyan-500 focus:ring-1 focus:ring-cyan-500 outline-none&#34; /&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div&gt;&#xA;        &lt;label for=&#34;secondary-last&#34; class=&#34;block text-sm font-medium mb-1&#34;&gt;Last Name&lt;/label&gt;&#xA;        &lt;input type=&#34;text&#34; id=&#34;secondary-last&#34; name=&#34;secondary_last_name&#34;&#xA;          class=&#34;w-full px-4 py-2 rounded-lg bg-neutral-800 border border-neutral-700 text-neutral-100 focus:border-cyan-500 focus:ring-1 focus:ring-cyan-500 outline-none&#34; /&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;mt-4&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;label for=&#34;secondary-email&#34; class=&#34;block text-sm font-medium mb-1&#34;&gt;Email&lt;/label&gt;&#xA;      &lt;input type=&#34;email&#34; id=&#34;secondary-email&#34; name=&#34;secondary_email&#34;&#xA;        class=&#34;w-full px-4 py-2 rounded-lg bg-neutral-800 border border-neutral-700 text-neutral-100 focus:border-cyan-500 focus:ring-1 focus:ring-cyan-500 outline-none&#34; /&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/fieldset&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;label for=&#34;language&#34; class=&#34;block text-sm font-medium mb-1&#34;&gt;Language &lt;span class=&#34;text-red-400&#34;&gt;*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/label&gt;&#xA;    &lt;select id=&#34;language&#34; name=&#34;language&#34; required&#xA;      class=&#34;w-full px-4 py-2 rounded-lg bg-neutral-800 border border-neutral-700 text-neutral-100 focus:border-cyan-500 focus:ring-1 focus:ring-cyan-500 outline-none&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;option value=&#34;English&#34; selected&gt;English&lt;/option&gt;&#xA;      &lt;option value=&#34;French&#34;&gt;French&lt;/option&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/select&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;label for=&#34;title&#34; class=&#34;block text-sm font-medium mb-1&#34;&gt;Presentation Title &lt;span class=&#34;text-red-400&#34;&gt;*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/label&gt;&#xA;    &lt;input type=&#34;text&#34; id=&#34;title&#34; name=&#34;presentation_title&#34; required maxlength=&#34;100&#34;&#xA;      class=&#34;w-full px-4 py-2 rounded-lg bg-neutral-800 border border-neutral-700 text-neutral-100 focus:border-cyan-500 focus:ring-1 focus:ring-cyan-500 outline-none&#34; /&gt;&#xA;    &lt;p class=&#34;text-xs text-neutral-500 mt-1&#34;&gt;Maximum 100 characters&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
    </item>
    
    <item>
      <title>Code of Conduct</title>
      <link>http://10.226.35.14:8080/coc/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>http://10.226.35.14:8080/coc/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Purpose&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;purpose&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;span&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#purpose&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;HUNTCON is dedicated to providing a safe, respectful, and inclusive experience for all participants — regardless of gender, gender identity, age, sexual orientation, disability, physical appearance, race, ethnicity, nationality, or religion.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;This Code of Conduct applies to all attendees, speakers, sponsors, partners, and staff throughout the entire event, including conference sessions, round tables, networking activities, and any related social events.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
    </item>
    
    <item>
      <title>Contact</title>
      <link>http://10.226.35.14:8080/contact/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>http://10.226.35.14:8080/contact/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Have questions about HUNTCON 2027? Reach out to us using the form below.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;form id=&#34;contact-form&#34; action=&#34;https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbwQNEnwbQtXCB7NHBCkNVH4pE5HeESVHho_e-5LSK4wGj_AOQWSWuReA1gYot8_J7Fp0w/exec&#34; method=&#34;POST&#34; class=&#34;mt-8 space-y-6 max-w-2xl&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&#34;grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div&gt;&#xA;      &lt;label for=&#34;contact-first&#34; class=&#34;block text-sm font-medium mb-1&#34;&gt;First Name &lt;span class=&#34;text-red-400&#34;&gt;*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/label&gt;&#xA;      &lt;input type=&#34;text&#34; id=&#34;contact-first&#34; name=&#34;first_name&#34; required&#xA;        class=&#34;w-full px-4 py-2 rounded-lg bg-neutral-800 border border-neutral-700 text-neutral-100 focus:border-cyan-500 focus:ring-1 focus:ring-cyan-500 outline-none&#34; /&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div&gt;&#xA;      &lt;label for=&#34;contact-last&#34; class=&#34;block text-sm font-medium mb-1&#34;&gt;Last Name &lt;span class=&#34;text-red-400&#34;&gt;*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/label&gt;&#xA;      &lt;input type=&#34;text&#34; id=&#34;contact-last&#34; name=&#34;last_name&#34; required&#xA;        class=&#34;w-full px-4 py-2 rounded-lg bg-neutral-800 border border-neutral-700 text-neutral-100 focus:border-cyan-500 focus:ring-1 focus:ring-cyan-500 outline-none&#34; /&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;label for=&#34;contact-email&#34; class=&#34;block text-sm font-medium mb-1&#34;&gt;Email &lt;span class=&#34;text-red-400&#34;&gt;*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/label&gt;&#xA;    &lt;input type=&#34;email&#34; id=&#34;contact-email&#34; name=&#34;email&#34; required&#xA;      class=&#34;w-full px-4 py-2 rounded-lg bg-neutral-800 border border-neutral-700 text-neutral-100 focus:border-cyan-500 focus:ring-1 focus:ring-cyan-500 outline-none&#34; /&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;label for=&#34;contact-subject&#34; class=&#34;block text-sm font-medium mb-1&#34;&gt;Subject &lt;span class=&#34;text-red-400&#34;&gt;*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/label&gt;&#xA;    &lt;input type=&#34;text&#34; id=&#34;contact-subject&#34; name=&#34;subject&#34; required&#xA;      class=&#34;w-full px-4 py-2 rounded-lg bg-neutral-800 border border-neutral-700 text-neutral-100 focus:border-cyan-500 focus:ring-1 focus:ring-cyan-500 outline-none&#34; /&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;label for=&#34;contact-message&#34; class=&#34;block text-sm font-medium mb-1&#34;&gt;Message &lt;span class=&#34;text-red-400&#34;&gt;*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/label&gt;&#xA;    &lt;textarea id=&#34;contact-message&#34; name=&#34;message&#34; required rows=&#34;6&#34;&#xA;      class=&#34;w-full px-4 py-2 rounded-lg bg-neutral-800 border border-neutral-700 text-neutral-100 focus:border-cyan-500 focus:ring-1 focus:ring-cyan-500 outline-none&#34;&gt;&lt;/textarea&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;button type=&#34;submit&#34;&#xA;class=&#34;px-8 py-3 rounded-lg bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-500 to-violet-600 text-white font-semibold hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity cursor-pointer&#34;&gt;&#xA;Send Message&#xA;&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
    </item>
    
    <item>
      <title>FAQ</title>
      <link>http://10.226.35.14:8080/faq/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>http://10.226.35.14:8080/faq/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;General&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;general&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;span&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#general&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Is HUNTCON free?&lt;/strong&gt;&#xA;Yes. Attendance is completely free, but &lt;a href=&#34;http://10.226.35.14:8080/registration/&#34; &gt;registration&lt;/a&gt; is mandatory.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Can I attend only one of the two days?&lt;/strong&gt;&#xA;Yes, you can attend Day 1 only, Day 2 only, or both.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How many attendees are expected?&lt;/strong&gt;&#xA;The event is designed for up to 100 participants.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Is this a recurring event?&lt;/strong&gt;&#xA;This is the first edition. We intend to organize HUNTCON every year.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
    </item>
    
    <item>
      <title>Info</title>
      <link>http://10.226.35.14:8080/info/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>http://10.226.35.14:8080/info/</guid>
      <description>&lt;div class=&#34;flex justify-center mb-0&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;img src=&#34;../images/mountain.png&#34; alt=&#34;Mountain&#34; class=&#34;w-full max-w-3xl h-auto rounded-lg&#34; /&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;About HUNTCON&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;about-huntcon&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;span&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#about-huntcon&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;While there are hundreds of renowned cybersecurity conferences worldwide — such as DEF CON, Black Hat, RSA Conference, BruCON, GreHack, and Hack.lu — very few events are dedicated exclusively to &lt;strong&gt;Threat Hunting&lt;/strong&gt;. The few that exist are primarily online and US-based. To our knowledge, there is currently no dedicated Threat Hunting conference in France.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
    </item>
    
    <item>
      <title>Registration</title>
      <link>http://10.226.35.14:8080/registration/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>http://10.226.35.14:8080/registration/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Register to attend HUNTCON 2027. Participation is free but registration is mandatory.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;form id=&#34;registration-form&#34; action=&#34;https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbyJ2nz-woupO7Y07qzJvbUyWgjN5PxiTmbw4unMlhpZhHKn5qmlYrgqJ8KhBU4s6vigBg/exec&#34; method=&#34;POST&#34; class=&#34;mt-8 space-y-6 max-w-2xl&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;label for=&#34;reg-company&#34; class=&#34;block text-sm font-medium mb-1&#34;&gt;Company &lt;span class=&#34;text-red-400&#34;&gt;*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/label&gt;&#xA;    &lt;input type=&#34;text&#34; id=&#34;reg-company&#34; name=&#34;company&#34; required&#xA;      class=&#34;w-full px-4 py-2 rounded-lg bg-neutral-800 border border-neutral-700 text-neutral-100 focus:border-cyan-500 focus:ring-1 focus:ring-cyan-500 outline-none&#34; /&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&#34;grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div&gt;&#xA;      &lt;label for=&#34;reg-first&#34; class=&#34;block text-sm font-medium mb-1&#34;&gt;First Name &lt;span class=&#34;text-red-400&#34;&gt;*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/label&gt;&#xA;      &lt;input type=&#34;text&#34; id=&#34;reg-first&#34; name=&#34;first_name&#34; required&#xA;        class=&#34;w-full px-4 py-2 rounded-lg bg-neutral-800 border border-neutral-700 text-neutral-100 focus:border-cyan-500 focus:ring-1 focus:ring-cyan-500 outline-none&#34; /&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div&gt;&#xA;      &lt;label for=&#34;reg-last&#34; class=&#34;block text-sm font-medium mb-1&#34;&gt;Last Name &lt;span class=&#34;text-red-400&#34;&gt;*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/label&gt;&#xA;      &lt;input type=&#34;text&#34; id=&#34;reg-last&#34; name=&#34;last_name&#34; required&#xA;        class=&#34;w-full px-4 py-2 rounded-lg bg-neutral-800 border border-neutral-700 text-neutral-100 focus:border-cyan-500 focus:ring-1 focus:ring-cyan-500 outline-none&#34; /&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;label for=&#34;reg-email&#34; class=&#34;block text-sm font-medium mb-1&#34;&gt;Email &lt;span class=&#34;text-red-400&#34;&gt;*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/label&gt;&#xA;    &lt;input type=&#34;email&#34; id=&#34;reg-email&#34; name=&#34;email&#34; required&#xA;      class=&#34;w-full px-4 py-2 rounded-lg bg-neutral-800 border border-neutral-700 text-neutral-100 focus:border-cyan-500 focus:ring-1 focus:ring-cyan-500 outline-none&#34; /&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;label class=&#34;block text-sm font-medium mb-2&#34;&gt;Want to actively contribute? (optional)&lt;/label&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;space-y-2&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;label class=&#34;flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;input type=&#34;checkbox&#34; name=&#34;role&#34; value=&#34;speaker&#34;&#xA;          class=&#34;form-checkbox&#34; onchange=&#34;toggleRoles()&#34; /&gt;&#xA;        &lt;span&gt;Speaker&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/label&gt;&#xA;      &lt;p id=&#34;speaker-note&#34; class=&#34;hidden text-sm text-neutral-400 ml-6&#34;&gt;(Please also use the &lt;a href=&#34;../cfp/&#34; class=&#34;text-cyan-400 hover:underline&#34;&gt;Call for Papers&lt;/a&gt; form to submit your presentation)&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
    </item>
    
    <item>
      <title>Speakers</title>
      <link>http://10.226.35.14:8080/speakers/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>http://10.226.35.14:8080/speakers/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Speakers and round table participants will be announced as the program takes shape. Interested in presenting? &lt;a href=&#34;http://10.226.35.14:8080/cfp/&#34; &gt;Submit a talk&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;hr&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Day 1 — Conference Speakers&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;day-1--conference-speakers&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;span&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#day-1--conference-speakers&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4 mt-6&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;border border-neutral-700 rounded-lg p-3 text-center&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&#34;w-12 h-12 mx-auto mb-2 rounded-full bg-neutral-800 flex items-center justify-center text-neutral-500 text-lg&#34;&gt;?&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;p class=&#34;font-semibold text-sm&#34;&gt;Talk #1&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  &lt;p class=&#34;text-xs text-neutral-400&#34;&gt;To be announced&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;border border-neutral-700 rounded-lg p-3 text-center&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&#34;w-12 h-12 mx-auto mb-2 rounded-full bg-neutral-800 flex items-center justify-center text-neutral-500 text-lg&#34;&gt;?&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;p class=&#34;font-semibold text-sm&#34;&gt;Talk #2&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
    </item>
    
